.TH SCREEN-TIME 1 "rofi-hub 0.2.0" "rofi-hub" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
screen-time \- local per-user screen-time tracker for Hyprland
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B screen-time
.I COMMAND
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B screen-time
records app-level usage from Hyprland events in a local SQLite database.
Window titles are parsed only far enough to find the event separator and are
never stored. Idle and suspend gaps are excluded. The database lives under
.IR ~/.local/state/screen-time/ .
.PP
The daemon is a systemd user service in packaged installs. The Rofi UI is
started through
.BR rofi-screen-time .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B daemon
Run the per-user tracker daemon. Normally managed by
.IR screen-time.service .
.TP
.BI render " [\-\-format rofi|rofi-theme] [\-\-date " YYYY-MM-DD "] [\-\-app " KEY "]"
Render the main day view or one app detail. The default format is
.BR rofi ;
.B rofi-theme
prints the generated Rofi theme. Without
.BR ROFI_RETV ,
the command prints a plain-text view.
.TP
.BI doctor " [\-\-json] [\-\-no-runtime]"
Check runtime, database, snapshot, and configuration health.
.B \-\-no-runtime
skips Hyprland, Rofi, logind, and runtime-directory checks, which is useful in
containers and CI.
.TP
.BI snapshot " \-\-to " DIR " [\-\-json] [\-\-no-config-hash]"
Write a consistent database snapshot and manifest to a new directory.
.TP
.BI check-data " \-\-against " DIR " [\-\-json] [\-\-allow-migration]"
Compare the live database with a snapshot fingerprint. A documented schema
migration requires
.BR \-\-allow-migration .
.TP
.B schema-version
Print the schema version supported by this binary.
.TP
.B checkpoint
Checkpoint and truncate the SQLite WAL.
.TP
.B config example
Print the commented configuration template.
.TP
.B config path
Print the configuration file path.
.TP
.BI config " init [\-\-force]"
Write the template if the configuration does not exist yet.
.B \-\-force
replaces an existing file.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SCREEN_TIME_STATE_DIR
Override the state directory.
.TP
.B SCREEN_TIME_RUNTIME_DIR
Override the runtime directory.
.TP
.B SCREEN_TIME_DB
Override the database path.
.TP
.B SCREEN_TIME_THEME
Theme file used by
.BR rofi-screen-time .
.TP
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
Base for the default state directory.
.TP
.B XDG_RUNTIME_DIR
Base for live and UI state files.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/screen-time/screen-time.db
Usage database.
.TP
.I ~/.config/screen-time/config.toml
Optional configuration.
.TP
.I /usr/share/screen-time/config.example.toml
Packaged configuration example.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success; non-zero on a database, configuration, or runtime error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rofi-screen-time (1),
.BR rofi-hub (1),
.BR hyprland (1)
